    "description": "A draugr is undead and can change its appearance, size, and physical traits. Depending on how long it has been dead, its body shows varying decay, from apparently intact flesh to a skeleton with missing bones. Any remaining skin is dull gray. Its eyes have lost their color, leaving only the darkness of the pupils. Many draugrs can also turn their physical bodies into smoke.",
